      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-12-002\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24043]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>3.WORK BASE ASSESSMENT TOOL</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24044]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24045]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Workplace based assessments</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24046]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>evaluate progression through training, they link teaching learning, and assessment in a structured way.</span><br><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Workplace based assessments identify your strengths and weaknesses.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24047]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Clinical based discussion: </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>CBD </strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24048]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>tool for supervised learning events based on a trainee\u2019s management of   patient </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>and provides</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> feedback on clinical reasoning, decision making and applied medical Knowledge in </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>relation to</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> patient care.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24049]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Mini clinical exams : </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Mini \u2013 c</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>ex</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> </strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24050]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>supervised learning event tool evalua</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>ting a clinical encounter with </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>patient to provide feedback on Skills essential for good clinical care e.g. history examination, clinical </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>reasoning.</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24051]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>OSATS</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>:</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Objective Structured Assessment of Technical Skills</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24052]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>A validated assessment tool to assess competency in a particular technique for a procedure fundamental to obs and gynae.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24053]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Formative assessments</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24054]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>assessment for learning used to provide feedback (mini-cex and CBD,</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>OSAT</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24055]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>record all formative OSATS in portfolio</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24056]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Summative Assessments</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>: </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24057]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Assessment of learning to demonstrate competence in a clinical situation, e.g. OSATS</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24058]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Formative and summative are not interchangeable, must b declared in advance either its formative or summative</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24059]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3 summative OSAT per procedure before doing it independently</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24060]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>One annual OSAT till CCT</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24061]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Examples/comparison of formative and summative OSAT</strong></u></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-table-scroll\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"mm-table\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:0pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:125.75pt;\"><col style=\"width:125.75pt;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:125.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Formative assessment</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:125.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Summative</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:125.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Feed back</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:125.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Pass/fail, completion of training</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:125.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Supervised learning</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:125.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Assessment of performance</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:125.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Annual job appraisal</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:125.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Theory test</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:125.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">peer observation</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:125.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">MRCOG 1,2,3</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:125.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Mock OSCE</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:125.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">MRCOG OSCE</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:125.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Induction interview</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:125.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\">Job interview/recruitment interview</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24062]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>NOTES: </strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24063]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Non-technical skills for surgeons This is the cognitive and interpersonal skills, e.g. to see and making leadership team working. The tool provides a framework and terminology for giving feedback under the following headings. Situational Awareness, Decision Making, Communication, Teamwork, Leadership </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24064]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Norm reference assessment</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24065]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Cambria\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Cambria\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>A norm-referenced assessment is\u00a0a type of standardized test that ranks test-takers against a peer group (norm group)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24066]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Cambria\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Students are compared to each other</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24067]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Cambria\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Fixed no of students fail each year</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24068]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Cambria\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Candidates ability influence standard</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24069]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Cambria\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Standards are not known in advance </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24070]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Cambria\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Criterion reference standard</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24071]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Cambria\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>evaluates a student's knowledge and skills against fixed, predetermined standards or learning objectives, rather than comparing them to peers.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24072]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Cambria\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Failure rates vary</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24073]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24074]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24075]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24076]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24077]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24078]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24079]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24080]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24081]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24082]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24083]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24084]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24085]\">\u00a0</p>",
